---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Learn how affiliate links and commissions may be used on our travel website."
>
  <main>
    <section class="container">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <p>
        Last updated: September 11, 2026
      </p>

      <p>
        Some of the links on this website may be affiliate links.
        This means that if you click on certain links and make a
        qualifying purchase or booking, we may receive a commission
        from the company or service provider.
      </p>

      <h2>How Affiliate Links Work</h2>

      <p>
        When you click an affiliate link, the third-party website
        may recognize that you were referred from our website.
        If you complete an eligible purchase or booking, we may
        earn a commission.
      </p>

      <h2>No Additional Cost to You</h2>

      <p>
        Using an affiliate link does not normally increase the price
        you pay. The commission is paid by the relevant company or
        affiliate program.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Recommendations</h2>

      <p>
        We aim to provide useful and honest travel information.
        The presence of an affiliate relationship does not mean that
        we guarantee the quality, availability, price, or performance
        of a third-party product or service.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>
        When you leave our website and visit a third-party website,
        your interaction is governed by that company's own terms,
        privacy policy, and other applicable policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about our affiliate relationships,
        please visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a> page.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
